window.products.push({"id":574167,"name":"Kotton Culture Reversible Pinch Pleated Down Alternative Comforter Set 600 TC 100% Egyptian Cotton Shell 300 GSM Microfiber Fill, 1 Pintuck Comforter ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S6VEjD7UL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"SIZE INFORMATION: 1 Piece 300 GSM Comforter (106\"X90\") and 2 Pillow Shams (20\"X36\"). EGYPTIAN COTTON SHELL & MICROFIBER FILL: With a long staple 100% Egyptian Cotton exterior and a cloud-like premium microfiber fill, the comforter provides a supremely soft feel and all-season breathability. 300 GSM fill weight, you get the cozy comfort of down without the feathers, odor, and sharp quills associated with goose or feather down. The microfiber fill is far superior to ordinary siliconized recron filling—delivering comfort and warmth all year round at an affordable price. STYLISH PINCH PLEATING: Evenly spaced and repeated puckered diamonds on the fabric are sewn in place by experienced artisans to create a textured, geometric pattern and bring an upscale look to your bed. With 600 thread count, this versatile comforter features pinch pleats on the face and solid hue on the reverse with coordinating pillow shams. Simply flip the comforter to switch between the pintucks and solid color, or give your bedding a fold-up top. BOX STITCH & CORNER LOOPS: Sewn corner loops are designed to anchor your duvet cover and protect the fluffy comforter from moving. Box stitch design keeps the fill in place and avoids clumping, so that the comforter maintains a fresh and fluffy look for long. EASY CARE: Wash this textured down alternative comforter in cold water separately on a gentle cycle and sun-dry at home. For more frequent washing, dry clean the plush comforter. Since the bag comes in vacuum-sealed packaging, it is recommended to gently tap the comforter set for increased fluffiness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S6VEjD7UL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kotton Culture","source_asin":"B082CXGZJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082CXGZJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082CXGZJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
