window.products.push({"id":574222,"name":"Burrito Tortilla Blanket Double Sided 47 inches for Kids, 280 GSM Cozy Flannel Fabric Novelty Giant Food Throw Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hTR3DWYNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【A REALISTIC BIG BURRITO TORTILLA】Still feeling down for the boring life. Then try our comical burrito tortilla blanket! It’s not just a warm blanket, but a real giant burrito.The graphic design makes it look like a large burrito crust. When you wrap yourself in this burrito tortilla blanket, you become a human burrito! You can experience the warmth and softness of a real burrito in person. 【HIGH QUALITY FLANNEL FABRIC MATERIAL】Our tortilla blanket is made of premium flannel fabric. Double-sided printed flannel design brings you comfort and warmth.And the weight per square meter is reached 280 gram! So of course this tortilla blanket is soft, cozy and skin-friendly. 【CARE INSTRUCTION】Dyed with an environmentally friendly dye, our tortilla blankets are not easy to fade. Gently washing machine cycle or hand-washing with cold water is recommended, then you can dry this flannel blanket by air or with low temperature. Please avoid using bleach and irons, which can damage the structure of this flannel blanket. 【NEWFANGLED GADGET】Are you still worried about which gift to get him or her for the holidays. Then our novel fluffy flannel food blanket is a good choice to please them. Whether it's Christmas, Halloween or Thanksgiving, you can give this funny food blanket to your loved ones. And then they turn into a giant burrito, too. It must be a newfangled experience for them. 【MULTI-FUNCTIONAL WRAP BLANKET】This Flannel burrito tortilla blanket is made of lightweight fabric, it’s a burrito tortilla blankets for adults, kids even pets.And suitable for any season and any occasion where you want to feel fuzzy and gentle hug. You can use it on couch, bed, picnic, camping, trip or party. As long as our taco tortilla blanket is around you, the fun and comfort will always be with you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hTR3DWYNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kimdee","source_asin":"B09B9VL47F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B9VL47F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B9VL47F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":574223,"name":"Lucian White Quilt Set King Size, Geometric Pattern Stitched Bedspread, Lightweight Breathable Summer Comforter Coverlet Sets for All Season, 1 Quilt ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81crBHJeVxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Outstanding Quality:Lucian bedding quilt set features with 100% premium microfiber cover and Down-like microfiber filling, skin-friendly softness & smooth. Bring breathable comfort for all season to you Elegant With Exquisite: Bedspread comforter set designed with classic geometric stiching patter, is a great chioce for all styles room decoration. Simple and elegant quilted design always in chic and match any room in a perfect way Lightweight & Durable:Quilt set stitched in multilayered air construction super lightweight. excellent stitching technology and the same wiring method on both sides prevents fill from shifting. tight stitching on the edging will hold up through washing and won't unravel for year long use. perfect for family with pets/kids Sizes & Measurements:The King size quilt set includes one quilt (108\" x 96\") & two pillowcases (20\" x 36\"). If you need quilt drapes all the way to the floor, you may choose larger size. EASY MAINTAIN (NO Dog's hairs left)—Machine washable with gentle cycle cold water, tumble dry on low heat (quilt set will soften after washed) What Will You Get:Lucian quilt set create a relaxed and cozy atmosphere for your room. Comfortable fabrics soft and cozy. Your family will fall in love with this simple and elegant coverlet at the first sign","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81crBHJeVxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lucian","source_asin":"B092JBMQY5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092JBMQY5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092JBMQY5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":574224,"name":"VENY TAYA Demon Slayer Tumbler with Lid, 30 Oz Water Cup Vacuum Insulated 8-12h, Anime Water Bottle Double Walls, Stainless Steel Coffee Mug for Home ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mX78XLoPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classical Demon Slayer Elements: Every “ Demon Slayer Fan” dreams of something unique to show their great love for this fantastic manga series. This is what you are seeking, not unnecessary small demon slayer merch, but a premium multifunctional tumbler you can use everyday. 8-12 h Hot/Cold Keeping: Equipped with double-wall vacuum insulation, this anime water bottle can keep your drink hot or ice for 8-12h, and it takes more than 24h to lose its heat completely. BPA-Free & 18/8 Stainless Steel: The material of this 30oz mug is 18/8 Stainless Steel and every part of it is BPA-Free. The bottom part is designed to be narrower ( diameter 2.7 in) to make it easier for hand hold and suitable for most car cup holder. Multiple Usage: Owning this 30 oz tumbler, you will never worry about your drinking anymore, both home and outdoor. Taking the watertight lid off it will be a normal water cup. With the lid equipped, it turns to a thermos, you can drink from the edge outlet or using straws. Tips & Lifetime Guarantee: Please keep the rubber plug of straw hole shut if you plan to keep the beverages insulated. Sometimes you may find difficult to open the lid due to “ thermal expansion and contraction”, just pull off the rubber plug and try again.The PVC cover of the water outlet is detachable, you can remove/install it freely. Our anime bottle has a lifetime guarantee, if you have any problems, please don’t hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mX78XLoPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VENY TAYA","source_asin":"B09T72451K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T72451K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T72451K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
