window.products.push({"id":574252,"name":"New York City Christmas Ornament - Times Square Yellow Cab - Christmas Tree Ornament from Christmas in New York Collection - Doublesided with Glitter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y5jvcOF8L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"It’s no secret that Christmas in New York is celebrated with much more pomp and ceremony than almost anywhere else in the world. This is why New York city during Christmas time is immortalized year after year in feature films and popular music. Were you raised in Manhattan? Alternatively, have you visited New York during Christmas previously? If so, and want to celebrate the memory of that experience this festive season, we can help. This is because at NY Poster Inc we create beautiful cards and New York themed Christmas ornaments, perfect for seasonal gifting and home decorative purposes. Designed right here in New York’s borough Staten Island, each of our unique Christmas ornaments are designed to help people all around the world celebrate Christmas in New York, no matter how far from the Big Apple they might be. Adorned with award winning photography by Igor Maloratsky, each of our traditional Christmas tree ornaments are guaranteed to become a popular talking point between home visitors and family members. Even better, our Christmas in New York ornaments make beautiful gifting pieces in their own right. With NYChristmasGifts, you don’t need to ice skate at the Rockefeller Center or be there in person as snow starts to fall over the iconic panorama of the Brooklyn Bridge this Christmas. Instead, we can help you celebrate New York during Christmas time right in the comfort of your own home. Made with special attention to detail, our hanging indoor Christmas decorations will add the perfect finishing touches to your home this Christmas. This being the case, order now in order to bring a little piece of New York city into your home this festive season.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y5jvcOF8L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NYChristmasGifts","source_asin":"B017MPRM38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017MPRM38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017MPRM38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
