window.products.push({"id":574316,"name":"Cookie Scoop Ice Cream Scoop Melon Scoop 18/8 Stainless Steel with Trigger Cupcake Scoops (0.6Oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513TIwgs7UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Extensive use: Using ice cream scoop we can use it to make beautiful round ice cream, delicious cookies, muffins, cupcakes and melon balls, meatballs, fruit and many healthy foods. Multi-function cookie scoop add more color to your kitchen! ✅EFFICIENT TRIGGER SYSTEM：Our stainless steel ice cream scoop cookie scoops feature an ergonomic trigger system that smoothly squeezes the filler.Ideal for use at home, in restaurants, ice cream parlors or parties. A simple squeeze releases cookie dough, making healthy foods such as ice cream and biscuits is a breeze. ✅Size - Capacity:Size - cookie scoop is 1.46 inch diameter, its capacity is 0.6 OZ/ 1.26 tablespoons/19 ml.The most complete size, find the best for you. ✅Easy to clean: The cookie spoon ice cream scoop is made of 8/18 high quality stainless steel and will not break or rust. It can be safely washed in the dishwasher, even if it is used for a long time, it will be like new. ✅Easy to operate：The perfect size allows you to make beautiful round ice cream, delicious cookies, sorbet, fruits, desserts, cakes, mashed potatoes, melon . . Is a practical kitchen utensils, suitable for kitchen, dining room, home, ice cream shop, party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513TIwgs7UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SZ-JIAHAIYU","source_asin":"B095HFD9NH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095HFD9NH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095HFD9NH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":574317,"name":"Manual Inspirational Collection 50 x 60-Inch Tapestry Throw, Messenger of Spring","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916gtrDMJVL._AC_SL1413_.jpg","description":"Although Thomas Lemuel Oates started Manual Woodworkers & Weavers in 1932, the story goes back further. The roots of the company can be found in Oates' entrepreneurial spirit. He and his brother used to farm the mountain areas of Bat Cave in western North Carolina. They would also help their mother find materials for her crafts. The sons began to make wooden whistles, buckets and bird-houses. They would sell their wares along with her crafts to the people from Charlotte that came through in their horse-drawn buggies on the way to the mountains. Later, Thomas worked at the Ashville Postcard Company. When the Depression hit, he lost his job, but it inspired him to go into business and sell crafts, like cornhusk dolls and woven pieces, that were produced by the local women. He had learned about the wholesale business while working at Ashville. He built a waterwheel to generate electricity at a mill, began making product and opened shop. Over the years, he expanded the company. His son, Lemuel Oates, who would next manage the company, says he worked in the business from a young age. He explains the products were made from cotton scraps left over from making socks. Half-inch circles would be looped together to form a variety of products. Lemuel Oates went to college and then settled in Richmond. In December 1973, he returned to Bat Cave and took over the company. In 2007 his son Travis and his daughter, Molly Oates Sherrill, took over the business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916gtrDMJVL._AC_SL1413_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Manual Woodworker","source_asin":"B00915WX96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00915WX96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00915WX96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
