window.products.push({"id":574399,"name":"ASIBT Rug Grippers Stopper Anti Slip Corner Non Slip Mat Carpets Pad, Black, 1/ 25 Inch in Thickness, 16 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wNJFc9o1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Way to use: Firstly, tear off the white film, and then stick this side to the corner of your carpet. Finally, take off the transparent film on the other side and press the rug on the floor. Specifications: Size (LWH): 10.5 x 10.5 x 0.1 cm Weight: 7.6 g (each) Color: black Note: Please keep your rug and floor clean before installing it. These rug stoppers fit for indoor items and they work better on hard surfaces, such as wood, tile and laminate, not suitable for silicone, rubber or flannelette bottomed rugs. How to regain stickiness: please use a wet towel to wipe the non-slip mat, and it will be sticky after dry. You are recommended to clean the mat when it is dirty or not sticky.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wNJFc9o1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASIBT","source_asin":"B06XB5XCVF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XB5XCVF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XB5XCVF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":574400,"name":"KESSAKU Ronin Collection 4-Knife Set - Forged High Carbon 7Cr17MoV Stainless Steel - 8-Inch Chef, 7-Inch Santoku, 7-Inch Nakiri, 3.5-Inch Paring with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ooMzHqzWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RONIN SERIES - Distinguished by the eye-catching subtle beauty of their finely etched blades & end caps, our Ronin Series knives were lovingly designed by our artisans to reflect centuries of traditional Japanese knife design, paired with cutting-edge nitrogen-cooled forging techniques & the highest-grade materials for unparalleled craftsmanship. Perfectly balanced contour-bolstered handles for amazing comfort & safety, with sharp & spectacular blades (up to 2x sharper than competing brands). MAJESTICALLY SHARP BLADE — Exquisite Seigaiha pattern. Individually handcrafted & hand-sharpened by our virtuoso technicians in the complex 3-stage traditional Honbazuke method to 16° per side for clean, precise, cuts, & amazing edge-retention. Our formulated High-Carbon 7Cr17MoV Stainless Steel adds enhanced corrosion resistance & non-stick properties, and these Precision-Forged, Nitrogen-Cooled, blades have a Rockwell Hardness of 58 for maximum strength, flexibility, & blade edge durability. TO HAVE & TO HOLD — An amazing first impression. Beautifully adorned with two gorgeous resin bands reminiscent of twin moons or celestial wedding rings, this knife's Mirror-Polished Pakkawood Handle will feel as if it were made just for you, specifically. This impact-resistant handle has Full Tang Strength for a lifetime of safe & precise use, is nearly impervious to heat, cold, & moisture, and its seamless build ensures that debris can't infiltrate its body, keeping it sanitary & hygienic. CONSTRUCTED TO LAST FOREVER - This knife will be your culinary companion for life & comes with Kessaku’s 100% Lifetime Warranty. Because we work tirelessly to ensure you’re delivered a true quality culinary masterpiece, all of our knives come with our Kessaku True Lifetime Warranty. Our very highest priority is that you are completely thrilled with our products and truly in love with our brand. Contact us with any issue or concerns and we will immediately do our absolute best to make it right. MAKES AN AMAZING PRESENT  —  This magnificent knife will arrive in style, greeting you in our beautifully designed & elegant Magnetic Closure Gift Box, Custom Sheath & Polishing Cloth. Perfect for a Birthday, Wedding, Anniversary, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Christmas, Housewarming. Give this to your favorite chef. The astonishing quality of this lovingly crafted, professional knife means you’ll be giving them a gift that they’ll have & use for eternity, so they’ll always think of you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ooMzHqzWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KESSAKU","source_asin":"B08MT3CL3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MT3CL3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MT3CL3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
