window.products.push({"id":574421,"name":"PSII Planet Sister Original Oversized Sherpa Hoodie Blanke ,Wearable Blanket for Adults, One Size Fits All(Beige-Black) X-Large a-899","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817iyopSihL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: Outer-Flannel; Inner-Sherpa Fleece; Cuffs-Cotton Blend.Easy Clean - Our Premium Blanket Hoodie Can Be Simply Washed It By Washing Machine Or Hands On Gentle, Separately In Cold Water And Then Tumble Dry On Low, And No Ironing. Not Shed And Fade. One Size Fits All – Just Pick A Color & Get Comfy! The Oversized Fit Is A Perfect Size For Most All Adults Two-Way Pocket Design: We Have Thoughtfully Designed A Direction-Finding Insertion Pocket And A Vertical Insertion Pocket, Which Can Store Mobile Phones, Snacks, Remote Controls, Etc., And Even Put Your Cute Little Animals In The Pocket To Keep Warm With You And Watch At Home You'Ll Love This Oversized Hoodie When You'Re On Tv, Just Curl Up On The Couch And Grab A Snack From The Big Pocket. Half-Height Zipper Design: In Order To Meet The Needs Of Different Body Sensations, We Have Designed A Half-Height Zipper, Which Can Wrap The Entire Neck When It Is Cold, And Can Be Opened To The Chest When It Is Hot To Facilitate Heat Dissipation, And The Zipper Design Is Easy To Put On And Take Off. Winter Essential：This Hoodie With Long Sleeves Covers You Completely Well And Allows You To Move And Use Your Hands Freely. It Keeps You Warm And Cozy.It’S Perfect For Staying Warm Around The Home, Watching Tv, Playing Video Games, At Sporting Events, School, Camping, Sleeping, Reading & Much More. Special Pattern Design: The Large Square Design Is An Exclusive Style Developed By Planet Sister. November 2022 Will Usher In The Four-Yearly Football World Cup. Wear A Plaid Blanket And Watch The Football Game With Friends.Wow,Nice Target Gender : Unisex","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817iyopSihL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PSII","source_asin":"B09Y5WBX42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574421","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y5WBX42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y5WBX42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":574422,"name":"Zdada 2PCS Stainless Steel Garlic Press Mincer Rocker Garlic Press Ginger Crusher for Home Kitchen(1PC Clean Brush and 1PC Garlic Peeler)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617vO9u3p+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Welcome to Zdada! Do you love dishes with fresh garlic and are aware of the health benefits of using freshly minced garlic? But avoid cooking garlic dishes simply because of frantic garlic peeling, crushing and later on... smelly hands and dishes in the result? The garlic press by Zdada, Our Kitchen Stuff comes in a bundle pack of 2pcs Garlic press, 1pc peeler and 1pc cleaning brush. It will be the best item in your kitchen if you are looking for one tool for Garlic peeling, crushing and mincing. To get the freshly minced garlic is very easy with this garlic peeler and presser. Just put garlic under the garlic mincer, apply a little force while rocking it back and forth and crushed garlic will gather at the top which can be transferred to your cooking dish directly with the clean brush or spoon. Hence your hands will not get smelly and there will be fewer dishes to clean. Product Specifications: √Material: 100% Premium Stainless Steel √Color: Silver/Black √Size: The Garlic press is 4x2.8x2inch.The cleaning brush is 4.4 inch.The garlic peeler is 5.2 inch Package Included: √2 x Garlic Press √1 x Cleaning Brush √1 x Garlic Peeler Use Garlic Mincer Perfectly 1.Please Clean With Detergent and Water Before First Use. 2.Cut Off Garlic Head With Knife ,Put Garlic into Silicone Peeler Roll it Until You Heard Crinkle Sounds.  3.You will find that garlic peel and garlic have been separated. 4.Press down vertically and a ' back and forth rocking' motion. 5. Collect the minced garlic on a plate with our Garlic Brush. 6. Wash the garlic mincer (solved in 1-2 minutes), or use a dishwasher to clean. Warm Tips 1.Please use the detergent and water to clean it before the first use.  2.Please keep out of reach of children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617vO9u3p+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zdada","source_asin":"B07X22NYGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X22NYGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X22NYGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
