window.products.push({"id":574526,"name":"King International Stainless Steel Lunch Box Containers,Bento Box for Adult,Steel Lunch Containers,Tiffin containers,Kids Lunch Box,Red Snack Box,Food","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DY0rQ4nEL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"This 3 tier Tiffin holds a good variety of large portion lunch items, you can use it for small get-togethers as this Tiffin comprises 3 layers each gradually tapering inwards when assembled. Containers are useful to carry food of various quantities. All 4 layers and lids are held firmly together by the separate clamping mechanism and it's perfect for all carrying lunch while traveling as this stainless steel product will keep your food hot for a long. It has exotic silver shining and it's Easy to clean. Made from 100% Stainless Steel making them highly durable and resistant to corrosion. Good size for packing SANDWICH & more The tiffin is 4.7'' X 4.7'' X 6' with three tiers, which is great for packing sandwiches and complete lunch. Our smart 4-compartment design means you can pack a sandwich in one compartment, salad or pasta in another, and sliced fruit in the third, making for a full meal Healthy, Safe & Eco-Friendly Plastic containers make for poor health choice. They may leach chemical toxins in your food and typically do not last very long. With our 100% Stainless Steel container you'd be making a healthy and safe choice, with the added benefit of getting years of usage. Because of the construction choice, the container is NOT leak proof.King International Tiffin products provide a great way to lead a healthy, safe, and eco-friendly lifestyle. Kid friendly designThe lunchbox is designed to be friendly for kids. The clip on the side is adjustable - you can easily loosen it or make it more snug by applying gentle pressure.The top tray is required for closing the lunchbox. The container can not be closed without the tray. Here’s how you can make lunchtime a fun experience! Besides having delicious food to pack for a tasty lunch, the only thing you really need is a strong, reliable lunch box that you can count on to keep your foods safe, healthy, separate and secure.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DY0rQ4nEL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"King International","source_asin":"B09G6L2P8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G6L2P8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G6L2P8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
