window.products.push({"id":574645,"name":"CREATIVELAND 1.4 Liter 47 Ounces High Borosilicate Glass Carafe/Pitcher Set of 2 with Stainless Steel Flip-top Lid,Hot/Cold Water Jug,Juice/Iced Tea,W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OigAOXyYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality Heat Resistant Borosilicate Glass Pitcher】This glass pitcher is made of premium Borosilicate. Hand-Made, BPA free & Lead free, durable, Heat and cold resistant, withstand temperature -20°C ~150°C. Refrigerator Safe & Stovetop Safe (small fire suggested) & Microwave Safe (except the lid).Also Equipped with a free cleaning brush, soft texture, easy to clean and does not damage the pitcher. 【Humanized Design & More Practical】The Flip-top Lid is made from SUS304 Stainless Steel, handmade with wide mouth, anti-drip spout, it is perfect for keeping the ice cubes, sliced fruit, tea bags inside the beverage, convenient to pour and easy to clean. The handle is large, adopting geometric design, which is stable and comfortable to hold. 【Perfect Opening & Large Capacity】1700ml/57.5oz, large enough to serve your family for daily drink or entertain guests at the party, allows you to enjoy more of your favorite drink at one time. Size: height-9.2in, bottom diameter-4.8in, lid diameter-3.6in. Fits well in most fridges. 【Multi-Functional Pitcher】This fridge pitcher with stirring rod, serving hot and cold beverage, water, juice, coffee, iced tea, lemonade, cocktail, milk, wine, white sangria and DIY the special drinkings you like, quite multi-functional pitcher/carafe for family use and all occasion, such as travel, office, party and so on. 【Great Creative Gift】Designed with elegant body, serving various beverage. We offer also a remarkably elegant and trendy gift box. It is a beautiful gift for women and men on Christmas, New Year's Day, Easter, Halloween, Thanksgiving Day, and other party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OigAOXyYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CREATIVELAND","source_asin":"B091BS5HDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091BS5HDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091BS5HDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
