window.products.push({"id":574746,"name":"Safari Ltd. | Leatherback Sea Turtle | Wild Safari Sea Life Collection | Toy Figurines for Boys & Girls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QafE8JyPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The largest living sea turtle, the leatherback is the second heaviest living reptile. It is named for its shell, which lacks the bony surface of most other turtles and is instead covered with thick layers of leathery skin. They eat mostly jellyfish. The Safari Ltd leatherback sea turtle toy animal figure captures the unique features of this distinctive turtle, from its beak to its large flippers to its namesake dorsal region. It measures 5 1/4 inches wide and 4 1/4 inches long. REALISTIC, DETAILED AND ACCURATE: With a focus on educating kids about the natural world, Safari Ltd's sea life figurines are thoroughly researched by experts and sculpted by professionals to ensure scientific accuracy and provide the most educational figurine possible to allow children to learn as they play! TESTED FOR QUALITY AND SAFETY - Safari Ltd ensures all of its products are tested to ensure they're safe for kids! Certified by accredited labs to be free of lead, phthalates, and other harmful chemicals, Safari Ltd sea life figurines are non-toxic and made to stand up to rigorous play. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS - Like all leatherback turtles, this figurine has a dark black carapace, head, and flippers, speckled with white dots. It stands 5.25 inches wide and 4.25 inches long, both measurements about an inch bigger than the dimensions of a credit card.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QafE8JyPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Safari Ltd.","source_asin":"B01MR34NTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MR34NTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MR34NTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":574747,"name":"Trudeau Stainless Steel Vegetable Steamer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s4GTelFNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Vegetable steamer, stainless steel, boxed. Amazon.com Steaming is a high-heat, low-fat method of cooking that ensures great flavor with minimal nutrient loss. A vegetable steamer can also double as a colander; wash vegetables or fruit and set them aside on the steamer to drain during the prep stages of cooking. The Trudeau stainless steel vegetable steamer has a familiar, blossom-shaped design that folds to look rather like a flying saucer. It sits on three sturdy steel legs that keep the basket out of boiling water during steaming. Most steamer baskets of this type have a small, hard-to-reach handle that makes extricating the steamer from a hot pan difficult. The Trudeau vegetable steamer handle, however, extends up like a plunger providing a broad grip and large oval loop that help keep hands away from scalding steam. The Trudeau vegetable steamer is made of dishwasher-safe steel and heat-resistant plastic. Allow the tool to dry completely before folding for storage. The steamer is 9 inches across when unfolded, and stands 5-1/2 inches tall with handle fully extended. Trudeau guarantees this product with a five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s4GTelFNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trudeau","source_asin":"B00062B0K6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574747","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00062B0K6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00062B0K6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
