window.products.push({"id":574829,"name":"F726/F1002 Hand Crafted Wooden Mask of Hindu God Bhairab Mahakal Wall Hanging Made in Nepal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p1xKVobwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amazing arts, Lord Bhairab is considered to be the incarnation (Avatar) of Lord Shiva. Bhairab has number of different forms. he is Shiva's another from in a terrible position and the most distinctive tantric form of shiva. He is nude, black or dark blue in color, sometimes on white. He has rolling eyes, many arms but usually one head. In his hand s are weapons, skull-cup, a wand with 3 skulls or a noose. He wears a necklace, garland, of skulls and has skulls in his crown. Hi hair is unruly. He may wear sandals and is often standing on a recumbent figure. It is believed that Bhairb is a god of strength, power and protect you and your home from all bad things from your life. Mask Size: 9 x 12 inches. F1002 a great decorative wall hanging/collectibles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p1xKVobwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bowlsofnepal","source_asin":"B014GASJCU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014GASJCU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014GASJCU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
