window.products.push({"id":574854,"name":"Progressive Furniture Mid-Mod Nightstand, 23x15x26, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":180.05,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31NKXmHo3iL._AC_.jpg","description":"Simplistic designs are streamlined with function and durability in our Mid-Mod collection. Sleek lines and petite moldings provide minimal obstruction to a handsome finish. This nightstand has French and English dovetail drawer construction, Kenlin metal drawer guides, inset drawers, transitional wide finger pulls in a bronze finish applied at top of drawers, and top drawers are felt lined. The base features a simplistic rail and contemporary flared leg. Also features a hand applied finish to achieve a beautiful, long-lasting finish; with the top having a melamine finish for durability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31NKXmHo3iL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive Furniture","source_asin":"B01MREGN5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MREGN5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MREGN5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":574855,"name":"Gravity Blanket Weighted Blanket for Adults, 15lbs White 48\"x72\" Twin/Single, The Original Weighted Blanket for Sleep, Cotton Made Blanket with Washab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ih98KKVCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TROUBLE SLEEPING? Gravity Blanket offers a Premium Weighted Blanket that uses lightweight on the body to improve sleep quality. The latest generation of Gravity's Original Blanket features internal upgrades while maintaining the blanket's signature look and feel. HIGH-QUALITY DESIGN: Our exterior Duvet Cover is made of super-soft micro-fleece material. While the interior of the Weighted Blanket is made of 100% cotton and fine-grade glass beads. Our upgraded zipper system helps the blanket stay inside the duvet. Gridded stitching on the weighted inner ensures the glass beads remain uniformly distributed that helps you wind down. PERFECT SIZE: Our Weighted Blanket measures 48\"x72\", providing a grounding experience for one user at a time. Use our Gravity Blanket weight chart below to find the perfect fit for this comfortable blanket. We recommended that you select one of our Weighted Blankets that’s about 10% of your body weight. We designed it in this throw blanket size to allow the weight to be evenly distributed over the user and because each user requires a weight specific to their body weight. CARE & LONG-LASTING: Our Breathable Duvet cover is machine washable while the internal blanket should be hand-washed only. To ensure your Blanket lasts, remove the cover before washing, and machine wash in cold water with similar colors. It is recommended to tumble dry on low and cool iron if needed. Not sure which Gravity Blanket to choose from? We offer our Original Weighted Blanket in 15, 20, and 35lb options and in different colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ih98KKVCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gravity","source_asin":"B0BCZV55QK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCZV55QK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCZV55QK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
