window.products.push({"id":574939,"name":"Heat Powered Wood Fan, TEENGSE 6 Blades Non Electric Fireplace Fan with Thermometer Strip for Home Wood Log Burning Stove Fireplace Circulating Warm A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QIvVSKSjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Newest Upgrade 6 Blade Fireplace Fan】Compared with the ordinary 5 blades fireplace fan and 4 blades fireplace fan.In addition, the 6 blades fireplace fan can warm up the room quickly, You can reduce the time of feeling cold. That's Great! 【Economical& Eco-Friendly Heat Powered Stove Fan】Fully utilize the heat of your wood stove and disperse it to your room without batteries or electricity. The 6-Blades heat-powered stove fan improved hot air circulation for greater comfort , and reduce 30% wood costs. You can enjoy the warm environment in your room. 【 High-temperature-resistant chip and powerful motor】The stove fans are equipped with high temperature-resistant chips which can withstand 50-500 degrees and keep working. So don’t worry that it will be burned out by the high temperature; At the same time, its powerful motor will also provide a stable and powerful guarantee. 【Quiet Work】Newly designed blade, larger air volume, lower noise. The moving part is the blades assembly, so the working noise is below 32DB. It will not interrupt your reading, work, and other activities，you can enjoy the warm air in a quiet and comfortable environment. 【Notice】1, Don't handle the base of the stove fan, do not set the stove fan down on an unprotected surface when it's hot, When moving or carrying the fan, please use the retractable handle.2, Improved stove fan adds a display to show the temperature of the radiator. when the display shows more than 50℃, you can continue to use the stove fan for 2-3 hours; if it displays 60℃. please remove the fan immediately to prevent the motor from burning out. 【100% After-Sales Service】 Each of our wood stove fans are equipped with The radiator temperature display bar to help you monitor the working temperature of the fireplace fan and ensure the safety of the fireplace fan. At the same time, it is equipped with a handle for easy movement and carrying. And it has been rigorously tested and put on the market. We can provide a 30-day refund service and after-sales protection of up to 6 months. If you have any questions, please contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QIvVSKSjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEENGSE","source_asin":"B09KLWSM8Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-574939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KLWSM8Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KLWSM8Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
